{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--38qWHyO7jrlYsfbiFwEBK--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/22a5144ee8d83bca-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/f5271587012faf78-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/4ed46ea138bb2900.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-d6297060eb558837.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-98a0bdaa30757bda.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ed30f9a4abb1cde3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/page-f5338757e88d3fa5.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Create Next App</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Generated by create next app\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"__variable_246ccd __variable_4c40f6 antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"bg-[#0a0e1a] text-white min-h-screen font-sans\"><nav class=\"fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-[#0a0e1a]/90 backdrop-blur border-b border-white/10 px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center\"><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight\">AryZam</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border transition border-[#00d4a0] text-[#00d4a0]\">EN</button><button class=\"text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border transition border-white/20 text-white/40 hover:text-white/70\">ES</button><a href=\"#waitlist\" class=\"bg-[#00d4a0] text-[#0a0e1a] text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-[#00bfa0] transition\">Join the waitlist</a></div></nav><section class=\"pt-40 pb-24 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\"><div class=\"inline-block bg-[#00d4a0]/10 border border-[#00d4a0]/30 text-[#00d4a0] text-xs font-semibold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-8 tracking-widest uppercase\">Quantum Risk Scanner · Pre-seed 2026</div><h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6\">Someone is recording<br/>your encrypted traffic<br/><span class=\"text-[#00d4a0]\">right now.</span></h1><p class=\"text-xl text-white/60 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10\">In 2029 they&#x27;ll be able to read it. Migration takes 3 years. The window to act opens today — and most companies have no idea how many vulnerable cryptographic assets they have.</p><a href=\"#waitlist\" class=\"inline-block bg-[#00d4a0] text-[#0a0e1a] font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-[#00bfa0] transition\">Show me my quantum risk →</a><p class=\"text-white/30 text-sm mt-4\">DORA · NIS2 · NIST FIPS 203/204/205 · NSA CNSA 2.0</p></section><section class=\"py-16 border-y border-white/10 bg-white/5\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center\"><div><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#00d4a0]\">~2029</div><div class=\"text-white/50 text-sm mt-1\">CRQC available</div></div><div><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#00d4a0]\">4M+</div><div class=\"text-white/50 text-sm mt-1\">TLS certificates exposed</div></div><div><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#00d4a0]\">3 years</div><div class=\"text-white/50 text-sm mt-1\">average migration timeline</div></div><div><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#00d4a0]\">0%</div><div class=\"text-white/50 text-sm mt-1\">mid-market firms with PQC inventory</div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-[#00d4a0] text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\">The problem</div><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-6 whitespace-pre-line\">A cryptographic time bomb\nis ticking in every enterprise</h2><p class=\"text-white/60 text-lg max-w-2xl mb-12\">Shor&#x27;s Algorithm will break RSA and ECC when a ~4,000 logical qubit quantum computer arrives. IBM and Google project that milestone at 2029. The Harvest Now, Decrypt Later attack is already happening: traffic encrypted today will be decrypted in 2029.</p><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6\"><div class=\"text-[#00d4a0] font-bold mb-2\">DORA</div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">Mandates cryptographic resilience for all EU financial entities. In force since January 2025.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6\"><div class=\"text-[#00d4a0] font-bold mb-2\">NIS2</div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">Covers critical infrastructure across 18 sectors. Cryptographic inventory required.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6\"><div class=\"text-[#00d4a0] font-bold mb-2\">NIST FIPS 203/204/205</div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">First PQC standards published August 2024. Migration starts now.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-[#00d4a0] text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\">The product</div><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Map. Prioritize. Prove.</h2><p class=\"text-white/60 text-lg mb-12\">Full cryptographic inventory in under 5 minutes. Read-only, metadata-only, GDPR DPA included.</p><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 flex gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">☁️</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Cloud scanner</div><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm\">AWS KMS · Azure Key Vault · GCP Cloud KMS — all regions simultaneously.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 flex gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">🪪</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Identity scanner</div><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm\">Microsoft 365 S/MIME · Active Directory · GitHub SSH · Linux authorized_keys.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 flex gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">💻</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Code scanner</div><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm\">60+ patterns across Python, Java, JS/TS, Go, C/C++ — detects hardcoded RSA and SHA-1.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 flex gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📦</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Dependency scanner</div><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm\">requirements.txt · package.json · pom.xml · go.mod · Cargo.toml — 35+ vulnerable libraries.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 flex gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">⚡</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Quantum Advantage Matrix</div><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm\">Score 0–100 per asset: qubit proximity × DORA urgency × HNDL penalty.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 flex gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📄</span><div><div class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Output in one command</div><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm\">HTML dashboard · Executive PDF · FIPS-aligned migration playbook · JSON inventory.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-[#00d4a0] text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\">Pricing</div><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-12\">IBM charges €500K.<br/><span class=\"text-[#00d4a0]\">We charge €4,800.</span></h2><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-1\">Starter</div><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#00d4a0] mb-1\">€4,800</div><div class=\"text-white/40 text-sm mb-4\">Rescan:<!-- --> <!-- -->€2,000/yr</div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">1 cloud provider · up to 500 assets · results meeting included</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl p-6 border border-[#00d4a0] bg-[#00d4a0]/5\"><div class=\"text-[#00d4a0] text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3\">Most popular</div><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-1\">Professional</div><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#00d4a0] mb-1\">€10,000</div><div class=\"text-white/40 text-sm mb-4\">Rescan:<!-- --> <!-- -->€4,000/yr</div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">All scanners · migration playbook · roadmap presentation</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-1\">Enterprise</div><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#00d4a0] mb-1\">Custom</div><div class=\"text-white/40 text-sm mb-4\">Rescan:<!-- --> <!-- -->Custom</div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">Multi-tenant · white-label · Big 4 report package</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-[#00d4a0] text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\">The team</div><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-12 whitespace-pre-line\">25 years of enterprise sales\n+ Princeton quantum research.</h2><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#00d4a0]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[#00d4a0] font-bold text-lg\">Z</div><div><div class=\"font-semibold\">Zayra Zambrano</div><div class=\"text-white/40 text-sm\">Co-founder &amp; CEO</div></div></div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm mb-4\">25+ years in enterprise IT and B2B sales across Spain and LATAM. The CISO network that generates the first clients.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-white/10 text-white/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Enterprise Sales</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-white/10 text-white/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Cloud Architecture</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-white/10 text-white/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">GCP</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#00d4a0]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[#00d4a0] font-bold text-lg\">A</div><div><div class=\"font-semibold\">Ariadna Gómez Zambrano</div><div class=\"text-white/40 text-sm\">Co-founder &amp; CTO</div></div></div><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm mb-4\">Electrical &amp; Computer Engineering, Princeton University (Class of 2029). IBM Qiskit Advocate. Builds the scoring engine and quantum physics foundation.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-white/10 text-white/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Quantum Computing</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-white/10 text-white/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">IBM Qiskit Advocate</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-white/10 text-white/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Princeton ECE 2029</span></div></div></div></section><section id=\"waitlist\" class=\"py-24 px-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center\"><div class=\"text-[#00d4a0] text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4\">Join us</div><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-4 whitespace-pre-line\">How many vulnerable assets\ndo you have in production?</h2><p class=\"text-white/60 mb-10\">Be the first to know. Join the waitlist — companies and early investors.</p><form class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 text-left space-y-4\"><div><label class=\"text-sm text-white/60 block mb-1\">I am</label><select class=\"w-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#00d4a0]\"><option value=\"company\">A company / CISO — I want a scan</option><option value=\"investor\">An investor — I want the full pitch deck</option></select></div><div><label class=\"text-sm text-white/60 block mb-1\">Name</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your name\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-white text-sm placeholder-white/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#00d4a0]\"/></div><div><label class=\"text-sm text-white/60 block mb-1\">Email</label><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-white text-sm placeholder-white/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#00d4a0]\"/></div><div><label class=\"text-sm text-white/60 block mb-1\">Company</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your company name\" class=\"w-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-white text-sm placeholder-white/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#00d4a0]\"/></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full bg-[#00d4a0] text-[#0a0e1a] font-bold py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-[#00bfa0] transition text-lg\">Sign me up →</button></form></section><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 py-8 px-6 text-center text-white/30 text-sm\">© 2026 AryZam · Quantum Risk Intelligence · aryzam.com</footer></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-d6297060eb558837.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[1959,[],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n5:I[7322,[\\\"974\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/page-f5338757e88d3fa5.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8:I[4431,[],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\na:I[5278,[],\\\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\\\"]\\nc:I[4431,[],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[4431,[],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\nf:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\n11:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/22a5144ee8d83bca-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\